  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:08.000" ttm:agent="v1">You have no heart</p>
      <p begin="00:10.704" end="00:12.204" ttm:agent="v1">Hoodrixh</p>
      <p begin="00:12.064" end="00:13.997" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:13.997" end="00:17.804" ttm:agent="v1">Big guap, bank account fat, lookin' healthy</p>
      <p begin="00:17.804" end="00:20.858" ttm:agent="v1">Making money, what’s new? Baby, tell me</p>
      <p begin="00:20.858" end="00:24.796" ttm:agent="v1">Back to New York 'cause it got colder, hit my nigga Danny</p>
      <p begin="00:24.796" end="00:27.813" ttm:agent="v1">Movin' fast, TSA can’t smell me</p>
      <p begin="00:27.813" end="00:34.862" ttm:agent="v1">Are we on the same page? Baby, tell me what's changed</p>
      <p begin="00:34.862" end="00:41.263" ttm:agent="v1">Are we on the same page? Baby, tell me what's changed</p>
      <p begin="00:41.263" end="00:45.688" ttm:agent="v1">Only sign that paper if it's more than a mill' 'cause I'm coolin'</p>
      <p begin="00:45.688" end="00:48.638" ttm:agent="v1">Just because I smile at you, we not cool, man</p>
      <p begin="00:48.638" end="00:52.376" ttm:agent="v1">Same niggas hatin’, hoes fanned out at the function</p>
      <p begin="00:52.376" end="00:55.682" ttm:agent="v1">That’s funny to me, sorry that your soulmate droolin'</p>
      <p begin="00:55.682" end="01:01.751" ttm:agent="v1">Watch your tone in my DM’s and you won't get finessed</p>
      <p begin="01:01.751" end="01:04.997" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta watch myself, my fans watching me too</p>
      <p begin="01:04.997" end="01:09.496" ttm:agent="v1">**** your text back, I don't need you, ho, I been runnin' up</p>
      <p begin="01:09.496" end="01:13.653" ttm:agent="v1">Big guap, bank account fat, lookin’ healthy</p>
      <p begin="01:13.653" end="01:16.435" ttm:agent="v1">Making money, what's new? Baby, tell me</p>
      <p begin="01:16.435" end="01:20.291" ttm:agent="v1">Back to New York 'cause it got colder, hit my nigga Danny</p>
      <p begin="01:20.291" end="01:23.454" ttm:agent="v1">Movin' fast, TSA can't smell me</p>
      <p begin="01:23.454" end="01:30.434" ttm:agent="v1">Are we on the same page? Baby, tell me what's changed</p>
      <p begin="01:30.434" end="01:38.434" ttm:agent="v1">Are we on the same page? Baby, tell me what's changed</p>
      <p begin="01:44.462" end="01:48.462" ttm:agent="v1">Icy</p>
    </div>
